Z||000000||SloPonti||02-14-2000||12:54 AM||||here are some more pictures of my motor and car as it is coming together! goint to try and drive it this coming weekend! the first picture is of my new exhaust tips that i got from superxmotorsports!! and i have to say that he is a top notch fiero seller and a great guy! the tips are 4.5 in diameter and about a foot long of stainless steal! these will get those riceburners! the next pictures of the motor that is running now and i must say it is running great!! i would like to thank fierodave and superxmotorsports for there time and great deals on the parts for this car! keep up the good work guys! i will also be posting more pictures of the car this week so check them out and let me know what you think!!!<BR>thanks<BR>Rob <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/my55ride/car1.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/my55ride/car1.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/my55ride/car2.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/my55ride/car2.jpg</A>  <A HREF="http://members.aol.com/my55ride/car3.jpg" TARGET=_blank>http://members.aol.com/my55ride/car3.jpg</A> <P>||||reg||6
