Z||000009||SloPonti||02-14-2000||03:29 PM||||thanks guys for the great comments! well it is hard to please everyone but the only thing that matters when your doing a project is that you please yourself and all i can say is that i am one happy fiero dude! to answer some of the questions! no i have not got my head stuck in the tips yet but the keyword there was yet! the fiero oil sticker is from rodney dickmans off the internet! he is also a great person to deal with! the chrome cap that the sticker goes on is from parts america! yes i painted the whole engine block red and you can see the motor alot better in person! the picture really pulls out the purple and not the red! if anymore questions just let me know!<BR>thanks<BR>Rob||||reg||1
