Z||000014||SloPonti||02-15-2000||12:18 AM||||i bought the exhaust tips from superxmotorsports and he charged me 100.00 plus shipping for both plus he through in a set of v6 tips that i could cut up and use the elbows off of! the tips are 4.5 inches wide and stailess steel! the brand name is MEGS exhaust tips! top notch! also i have never been pulled over for the pontiac sticker yet! so i think it is legal! <BR>thanks<BR>Rob||||reg||14
